Package: HockeyModel
Title: NHL Hockey Model
Version: 0.1.2026.1
Authors@R: person("Philip", "Bulsink", email = "bulsinkp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9668-2429"))
Description: Using various techniques, predict the winners of upcoming NHL hockey
    games, the expected points for the season, and odds for playoffs & cup winning.
    Includes parallel support for PWHL (Professional Women's Hockey League) game
    data and predictions via the HockeyTech API.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
